<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts IBM view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts IBM view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Steve Milunovich said he cut his second quarter and full-year earnings estimates for International Business Machines Corp.</p>
<p>-- said the year is expected to be more back-end loaded.</p>
<p>-- said he cut his second quarter estimate to $2.80 a share from $2.97, and cut his 1997 estimate to $12.30 a share from $12.50.  </p>
<p>-- cited currency fluctuations and the transition to a new mainframe model.</p>
<p>-- said he was maintaining his outperform rating on IBM.</p>
<p>-- IBM shares were off 4-1/8 at 132-1/2.</p>
</text>
